@startuml researcher_loop
!include style.puml
title Researcher agent loop (ReAct) - activity diagram

|Researcher (Python)|
start
:Build the task message
(questions, targets per question,
sources saved before a resume);
repeat
  |Gemini API|
  :Reason about progress and
  choose the next tool calls;
  |Researcher (Python)|
  if (Reply contains tool calls?) then (no)
    if (Questions still need sources
    and fewer than 2 reminders sent?) then (yes)
      :Remind Gemini which
      questions still need sources;
    else (no)
      break
    endif
  else (yes)
    fork
      :Search tool
      (web, news, Wikipedia, papers);
    fork again
      :open_source (read the page,
      score its trust tier,
      save it under a lock);
    fork again
      :coverage_report or
      finish_research
      (refused while a
      question has
      no source);
    end fork
    :Send every result back in one message
    (role "user", marked untrusted_data);
  endif
repeat while (Finished, source budget reached,\nevery question covered or turns used up?) is (no)
-> yes;
:Return the saved sources
to the pipeline;
stop
@enduml
